  ## Data Isolation & Confidentiality
  All code generation and verification workflows run in sandboxed container instances. Your source code and AST indices are isolated per project workspace.

  ## Zero Model Training
  StructZero never uses customer code, project DNA graphs, or execution transcripts to train public AI models.

  ## Data Retention
  Workspace audit transcripts are retained locally within your project environment (`.system_generated/logs`) under customer control.
